{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1325782-the-resplendent-cat-girl-generals","id":1325782,"title":"The Resplendent cat girl generals","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-18T17:16:54-07:00","id":1325782,"title":"The Resplendent cat girl generals","content":"So my solar is a \u201cclassic\u201d essence 3 twilight with supernal medicine who dabbles with crafting and celestial sorcery who lives in a flying castle he built and travels around with his circle and self proclaimed elemental of style.<br /> He is a House Kathak dynast who spent time in the legions and teaching in the house of bells before he had to flee the realm for becoming a solar after his breakthroughs in medicine studying essence flows chi etc. But being a bad dynast he is quite spoiled and biased. This is further exacerbated by him being a twilight so you get the general idea .He is a pervy older gentleman who likes the finer things in life .<br /> <br /> Now those things aside he made a guardian deity to protect his flying castle as obviously everyone in their right mind would want to steal one, unfortunately one time , when he was away looking for the circles dawn caste away waging war, his castle got attacked by naughty dragon bloods who kicked the poor deity\u2019s head in and occupied his castle. To add insult to injury they did this just after he finished plumbing and hot water.<br /> <br /> So faced with such outrage a classic twilight response rather than negotiating or asking allies etc for help must be moar science more magic to deal with the problem at hand . I\u2019m getting to the topic of this discussion now: So I was thinking wouldn\u2019t it be awesome if he had 5 sexy cat girl generals one themed for each direction / element to counter each element of the usual wyld hunt and protect his castle while the solars are away saving the world.<br /> <br /> Now I\u2019m looking for suggestions what kind of cat girl should represent each direction and what kind of panoply I should craft for them what to name them as well as whether I should give them any specific powers to counter corresponding dragon styles. I\u2019m not sure whether you can grant knowledge of martial art charms to beings you create that are equivalent to 2nd circles.<br /> Like For North like Maybe Lynx Girl or British Blue hair and if air is countering earth would she need a giant piercing weapon to counter earth soak ? Or should same element counter each other and give them resistance to anima flare if that element.<br /> <br /> All suggestions are welcome.<br /> <br /> P.S demons are bad mkay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12796,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12796-beast-of-bitter-oblivion","user":"Beast of Bitter Oblivion","date":". 07-18-2019, 08:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12796-beast-of-bitter-oblivion","name":"Beast of Bitter Oblivion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12796_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T18:56:05-07:00","id":1325814,"title":"","content":"He's breeding feline type generals? He has the lab for this sort of project?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord","name":"Uknown DarkLord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3012_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T21:57:08-07:00","id":1325870,"title":"","content":"a leopard or jaguar