ey":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T04:57:42-07:00","id":1325936,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uknown DarkLord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1325782-the-resplendent-cat-girl-generals?p=1325927#post1325927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He doesn't and he surely would like a peek at yours.<br /> <br /> As far as knowledge of MA goes, if you have some sort of AI instructor to instruct in the five elemental dragon styles that can be used to implant knowledge during their growth, then that might work. Otherwise, I think you need some sort of mentor.<br /> <br /> Also, why not task bind elementals? One elemental of each element and give them some equipment or essence boosting?</div> </div> </div> </div>Why? Because they are not sexy cat girl war gods. <br /> <br /> P.S before he had his flying castle he had to work out of a cart with a giant tank full of floating limbs and bits overseen by his hunchback attendant Igor. Sadly craft genesis no longer exists so I have to make do with celestial workings and supernal medicine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12796,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12796-beast-of-bitter-oblivion","user":"Beast of Bitter Oblivion","date":". 07-19-2019, 08:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12796-beast-of-bitter-oblivion","name":"Beast of Bitter Oblivion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12796_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016